  "key_finding": "Default LLM.int8() (threshold=6.0) preserves accuracy (+0.33% PPL) at the cost of higher energy consumption (+32.7%). Pure INT8 (threshold=0.0) reduces energy marginally (-3.1%) but causes unacceptable accuracy degradation (+25.38% PPL). This validates the bitsandbytes design philosophy of prioritizing accuracy preservation.",

